flowchart TD
    Start([User Types Query]) --> Frontend[Frontend: Next.js]
    Frontend -->|HTTP POST /api/v1/query| API[API Layer: FastAPI]
    
    API --> QueryParser{Query Parser<br/>Hybrid NER + Llama}
    
    QueryParser -->|Step 1| IntentDetect[Intent Detection<br/>Pattern Matching]
    IntentDetect -->|Load Templates| TemplateDB[(PostgreSQL<br/>API Templates)]
    TemplateDB -->|intent_keywords| IntentDetect
    IntentDetect -->|intent + confidence| SlotExtract
    
    QueryParser -->|Step 2| SlotExtract[Slot Extraction Pipeline]
    
    SlotExtract --> SpaCy[spaCy NER<br/>en_core_web_md]
    SpaCy -->|PERSON, EMAIL, PHONE| SpaCyResult[entities]
    
    SlotExtract --> Llama[Llama 3.2 3B<br/>+ JSON Schema]
    TemplateDB -->|slot definitions| Llama
    Llama -->|structured JSON| LlamaResult[slots]
    
    SlotExtract --> Regex[Regex Patterns<br/>username:, password:]
    Regex -->|explicit matches| RegexResult[slots]
    
    SlotExtract --> Context[Contextual Rules<br/>'for X and Y']
    Context -->|domain patterns| ContextResult[slots]
    
    SpaCyResult --> Merge[Intelligent Merge<br/>Priority: Context > Regex > Llama > spaCy]
    LlamaResult --> Merge
    RegexResult --> Merge
    ContextResult --> Merge
    
    Merge -->|Validate| AntiHallucinate{Anti-Hallucination<br/>Check}
    AntiHallucinate -->|Valid| ParsedResult[Parsed Result:<br/>intent + slots + confidence]
    AntiHallucinate -->|Invalid| Merge
    
    ParsedResult --> CheckDataset{Dataset Exists?<br/>embeddings >= 10}
    
    CheckDataset -->|No| GenDataset[Dataset Generator<br/>Generate 50 Variations]
    GenDataset -->|CSV + JSON| DatasetFiles[(datasets/<br/>intent_xxx.csv)]
    
    CheckDataset -->|Yes| Search
    DatasetFiles -. optional .-> ResponseBuilder
    
    Embed[Embedding Manager<br/>Sentence Transformers]
    DatasetFiles --> Embed
    Embed -->|384-dim vectors| Redis[(Redis Vector DB<br/>idx:apis)]
    
    Redis --> Search[Vector Search<br/>Cosine Similarity]
    ParsedResult -->|user query vector| Search
    
    Search -->|top_k matches| Results[Search Results<br/>with similarity scores]
    
    Results --> ResponseBuilder[Response Builder<br/>Format JSON]
    ParsedResult --> ResponseBuilder
    
    ResponseBuilder -->|HTTP 200 OK| Response{JSON Response}
    
    Response -->|Display| Frontend
    
    Response --> IntentOut[intent: 'update_profile']
    Response --> SlotsOut[slots: username, password]
    Response --> ConfOut[confidence: 0.95]
    Response --> MatchesOut[best_matches: Array]
    Response --> SearchOut[search_results: Array]
    
    IntentOut --> UI[Frontend UI]
    SlotsOut --> UI
    ConfOut --> UI
    MatchesOut --> UI
    SearchOut --> UI
    
    UI --> End([Display Results to User])
    
    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style End fill:#e1f5e1
    style QueryParser fill:#fff3cd
